flowchart TB
    R[Travel request arrives]

    R --> Q1{Can tasks split cleanly and run in parallel?}
    Q1 -->|Yes| SW[Supervisor-Worker]
    Q1 -->|No| Q2{Do we need explicit opposing reasoning?}

    Q2 -->|Yes| DB[Debate]
    Q2 -->|No| Q3{Do we want many independent strategies in parallel?}

    Q3 -->|Yes| SM[Swarm]
    Q3 -->|No| Q4{Do multiple stakeholders need approval?}

    Q4 -->|Yes| CM[Committee]
    Q4 -->|No| P2P[Peer-to-Peer]

    SW --- SWN[Fast orchestration, central control]
    DB --- DBN[Structured tradeoff reasoning]
    SM --- SMN[High diversity, higher compute]
    CM --- CMN[Governance, vote, and audit trail]
    P2P --- P2PN[Direct bargaining between equals]